      "t": "Determined to break off their relationship cleanly, Max meets Sasha and tells her they need to talk seriously. Before he can say a word, however, Sasha pulls him into a fitting booth to show off the new swimsuit she bought for Cyprus, completely derailing his breakup speech.",
